he latest price.\n\nPrice Target $98.15 (28.37% upside) Analyst Consensus: Buy\n\n### Block Transcript: Goldman Sachs Communacopia + Technology Conference 2026\n\nBlock says it is opening its Cash App score to external lenders for the first time. Using Nova Credit as a distribution partner, Block will make Cash App's proprietary, cash flow-based credit score av...\n\n7 weeks ago - PYMNTS\n\n### Block Will Open Its Cash App Score to Lenders with Nova Credit's Cash Flow Intelligence Platform as Partner\n\nDISTRIBUTED-WORKFORCE/OAKLAND, Calif.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) today announced that it will open the Cash App Score to external lenders for the first time, with Nova Credit as a distr...\n\n7 weeks ago - Business Wire\n\n### Block's Neighborhoods Adds 30,000 More Sellers as Square and Cash App Help Build Local Commerce Network\n\nDISTRIBUTED-WORKFORCE/OAKLAND, Calif.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) today announced that Neighborhoods, the experience that connects Square sellers with Cash App customers to drive discove...\n\n2 months ago - Business Wire\n\n### Bitcoin, crypto shares climb after Trump pushes Clarity Act\n\n### Cash App and MoonPay Team to Offer Crypto Purchases\n\n### Square Accelerates Push to Integrate Small Business Finance\n\n### Block Transcript: Investor update\n\nMargin expansion and profitability guidance have improved, with investments in AI and go-to-market driving product velocity and customer acquisition. Lending products show strong ROIC, and Cash App continues to grow through innovative channels like Neighborhoods and managed accounts for kids.","title":"Block (XYZ) Stock Price & Overview","url":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/xyz/"},{"author":null,"id":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/xyz/statistics/","image":"https://stockanalysis.com/stockanalysis-1200x630.png","text":"Block (XYZ) Statistics & Valuation\n\n76.46 -2.56 (-3.24%) At close: Oct 23, 2026, 4:00 PM EDT\n\n76.50 +0.04 (0.05%) After-hours: Oct 23, 2